{% comment %}
  SHEmakes — the free-shipping progress bar.

  The threshold used to be announced once in a banner at the top of the site
  and never mentioned again. Here it is a number that keeps counting down on
  the screen where it can still change the order — the cheapest change on the
  whole plan, and the one measured by average order value.

  Rendered by Liquid from `cart.total_price`, so it is correct on first paint
  rather than flashing in after a script runs. Dawn re-renders the cart section
  on every quantity change, which brings this with it.

  Usage:
    {% render 'sm-shipping-bar', threshold: 15000 %}

  threshold — in cents, matching Shopify's own money handling.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign threshold = threshold | default: 15000
  assign total = cart.total_price
  assign remaining = threshold | minus: total

  if remaining < 0
    assign remaining = 0
  endif

  assign percent = 0
  if threshold > 0
    assign percent = total | times: 100 | divided_by: threshold
  endif
  if percent > 100
    assign percent = 100
  endif
-%}

<div class="sm-shipbar">
  {%- comment -%}
    The truck rides the fill, the way the shop's live cart does it: the bar on
    its own is a number, the truck is a distance.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div
    class="sm-shipbar__track"
    role="progressbar"
    aria-valuenow="{{ percent }}"
    aria-valuemin="0"
    aria-valuemax="100"
    aria-label="Progress towards free shipping"
  >
    <div class="sm-shipbar__fill" style="width: {{ percent }}%"></div>
    <span class="sm-shipbar__truck" style="left: {{ percent }}%" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 3h15v13H1z"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg></span>
  </div>

  <p class="sm-shipbar__text">
    {%- if remaining == 0 -%}
      Your order ships free.
    {%- else -%}
      You are only <span class="sm-shipbar__amount">{{ remaining | money }}</span> from Free Shipping!
    {%- endif -%}
  </p>

  <p class="sm-shipbar__meta">{{ threshold | money }}</p>
</div>
